# Section 11, turning polarization on: POL with its two prompts.  The prose after it is pinned too: the mode
# survives a LOAD and the LOAD names it (Section 3, session options).
# COPY: $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/examples/Cassegrain.in s11
cd $TMP/s11
# TRANSCRIPT: s11_pol
pol
1,0
0,0
# TRANSCRIPT-OFF
old Cassegrain
# EXPECT: Polarization turned on\s+Vector diffraction enabled\s+Enter Ex0 \(real,imag\): \[[^\]]*\]: 1,0\s+Enter Ey0 \(real,imag\): \[[^\]]*\]: 0,0
# EXPECT: LOAD: session modes in force: POLARIZATION
# EXPECT-NOT: forrtl
